189 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 61 0 R/E(A modified version of the KJ-500 model redesigned to resemble the KJ-200 aircraft. The changes included replacing the radome with a beam radar, adjusting the tail geometry, and modifying the fuselage base from a Y-9 to a Y-8 configuration to better capture the distinct appearance of the KJ-200.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[2]>>
