endobj

210 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 63 0 R/E(The first part of this project was to design a structure that could keep the components in place. An internal support structure designed to align and hold the Kowa lens, NVIDIA Jetson, C/CS adapter, and Arducam board. The design was made to allow adjustments when needed, while also enclosing the Jetson in a way that supports heat dissipation and system integration.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

211 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 63 0 R/E(The structure has been divided into two parts:)/Pg 20 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

212 0 obj
