endobj

213 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 389 0 R/E(The backend box which houses the Jetson. The main computer on board to process raw sensor data, enhance image resolution, and perform object detection. Cutouts have been made to aid heat dissipation.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

214 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 63 0 R/E(This structure was designed to be placed into a 3U frame as illustrated in the designs made below.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[7]>>
